  "description": "JUWZOS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C29 H27 Eu3 F42 O11. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.710-3.820 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.18-101.26°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu2(μ2-ORF)3(μ3-ORF)2Eu(ORF)2(DME)2. Article name explicitly identifies I(I), I(II).",
